        <p class="gs-card-desc">What to expect physically after a late pregnancy loss or neonatal death — and how to care for yourself when care feels impossible.</p>
        <span class="gs-card-arrow">Read the guide</span>
      </button>
      <button class="gs-card" id="gcard-partners">
