        <div class="who-member">
          <div class="who-photo-wrap">
            <img class="who-photo" src="/assets/story-photo-4.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Oksana Gorbunova">
          </div>
          <div class="who-info">
            <div class="who-name">Oksana Gorbunova</div>
            <span class="who-role">Secretary &amp; Communications</span>
            <span class="who-loc">Paris, France</span>
            <p class="who-bio">Based in Paris, Oksana brings extensive experience in marketing and communications to MIMATIS. A mother herself, she believes how an organisation communicates shapes whether bereaved parents feel seen or invisible. She is committed to ensuring MIMATIS reaches every family that needs it &mdash; clearly, compassionately, across every border.</p>
