      <div class="who-note-rule"><span>A note from the founder</span></div>

      <div class="who-compact" style="margin-top:2rem">
        <div class="who-compact-card">
          <span class="who-compact-label">Mission</span>
          <p class="who-compact-text">To ensure every bereaved parent &mdash; wherever they live, whatever language they speak &mdash; can find support after the loss of a baby. Without barriers. Without cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who-compact-card">
          <span class="who-compact-label">Vision</span>
          <p class="who-compact-text">A world where bereavement care is not a privilege of language or geography, but a right that follows every family, wherever life has taken them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who-compact-card">
          <span class="who-compact-label">Why we exist</span>
          <p class="who-compact-text">Support after loss exists &mdash; but scattered, hard to find, and almost always in one language. MIMATIS brings everything into one place, available at any hour, in any country.</p>
        </div>
      </div>



      
    </div>
    <div class="story-mag-footer">
      <span class="story-footer-l">MIMATIS &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; mimatis.org</span>
      <span class="story-footer-r">For Maya, and every baby who came before and after.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- COLLABORATION PAGE -->
<div id="pg-collab" class="pg">

  <div class="collab-hero">
    <span class="sec-eye">Work with MIMATIS</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Collaboration &amp;<br><em>Partnership</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="collab-doc">

    <p class="cd-lead">MIMATIS exists to change what happens after baby loss.</p>
    <p>We support parents after miscarriage, stillbirth, and neonatal loss with trusted resources, compassionate guidance, and access to support across countries.</p>
    <p>We also raise awareness, educate, and help close the gap in aftercare so more parents receive the understanding and support they deserve at one of the most vulnerable moments in their lives.</p>
    <p class="cd-build">If you work in healthcare, research, advocacy, or funding &mdash; we would love to build with you.</p>

    <div class="cd-section">
      <h3>Charities &amp; organisations</h3>
      <span class="cd-tagline">Be part of the support network</span>
      <p>If you support bereaved parents, MIMATIS can help you reach the families who need you most.</p>
      <p>Get listed. Be found. Make support easier to access.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cd-section">
      <h3>Healthcare professionals</h3>
      <span class="cd-tagline">Give families a trusted next step</span>
      <p>MIMATIS helps parents find help when they leave the hospital and need it most.</p>
      <p>Share MIMATIS with your patients and bring better aftercare into the conversation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cd-section">
      <h3>Researchers &amp; academics</h3>
      <span class="cd-tagline">Help shape the evidence</span>
      <p>We curate and share research that raises awareness and supports better care for bereaved parents.</p>
      <p>Contribute your work. Help turn evidence into change.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cd-section">
      <h3>Funders &amp; partners</h3>
      <span class="cd-tagline">Help us grow what parents need</span>
      <p>We are building MIMATIS to reach more countries, more languages, and more parents &mdash; so that no one is left alone after loss.</p>
      <p class="cd-emph">Support a platform that combines awareness, education, and compassionate care.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="cd-close">MIMATIS is where support, awareness, and action meet.</p>

    <div class="cd-actions">
